		d="M14 30c-6.6 0-12-5-12-11.2C2 12.8 6.9 8 13 8c1.3 0 2.6.2 3.7.7C18.7 4.3 23.6 1 29.3 1c7.4 0 13.6 5.4 14.6 12.4.4 0 .7-.1 1.1-.1 6.6 0 12 5.1 12 11.4S51.6 36 45 36H14.5c-.2 0-.3 0-.5-.1V30Z"
